---
// A short notice after an action, over the page ("Guardado · Ver guardados", "Enlace copiado · Enviar por WhatsApp":
// scripts/views/notice.ts). A live region, always in the page and empty between notices, so screen readers hear
// each one. Placed in each page's order where the keyboard should reach its button.
---

<div class="notice" id="notice" role="status"></div>
